# Build context is apps/backend (see Dockerfile). Allowlist rather than denylist: the
# image needs six things, and a denylist silently ships every tool cache invented later.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!src
!tests
!migrations

# Re-excluded inside the directories admitted above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Belt and braces: secrets stay out even if the allowlist above ever widens.
.env
.env.*
